  "name": "Mighty Summoner (Circle of the Shepherd)",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Beasts and fey that you conjure are more resilient than normal. Any beast or fey summoned or created by a spell that you cast gains the following benefits:</p><ul><li>The creature appears with more hit points than normal: 2 extra hit points per Hit Die it has.</li><li>The damage from its natural weapons is considered magical for the purpose of overcoming Immunity and Resistance to nonmagical attacks and damage.</li></ul>",
